 "lines": [
  {
   "n": 1,
   "speaker": "homie",
   "text": "DEEZ NUTS! DEEZ NUTS!"
  },
  {
   "n": 2,
   "speaker": "me",
   "text": "BRUH. My homie was watching YouTube in class the other day, and he turns to me like..."
  },
  {
   "n": 3,
   "speaker": "homie",
   "text": "Bro. Do you know who Deez is?"
  },
  {
   "n": 4,
   "speaker": "me",
   "text": "And me, not knowing this MOTHERFUUUCKER was watching old-ASS Vine videos about Deez Nuts... I said..."
  },
  {
   "n": 5,
   "speaker": "me",
   "text": "WHO THE FUUUCK IS DEEZ?!"
  },
  {
   "n": 6,
   "speaker": "homie",
   "text": "DEEZ NUTS IN YOUR MOUTH!"
  },
  {
   "n": 7,
   "speaker": "me",
   "text": "LOUD AS FUUUCK, BRO! The ENTIRE class turned around and started DYING! And I'm like, THIS SHIT IS STUPID AS FUUUCK, BRUH!"
  },
  {
   "n": 8,
   "speaker": "me",
   "text": "Then at lunch?! This BITCH-ASS MOTHERFUUUCKER would NOT! STOP! EVERY! DAMN! CHANCE!"
  },
  {
   "n": 9,
   "speaker": "homie",
   "text": "Yo bro. Deez nuts. Deez nuts. Deez nuts! DEEZ NUTS!"
  },
  {
   "n": 10,
   "speaker": "me",
   "text": "NON! FUUUCKING! STOP!"
  },
  {
   "n": 11,
   "speaker": "me",
   "text": "BRO, SHUT THE FUUUCK UUUP!"
  },
  {
   "n": 12,
   "speaker": "me",
   "text": "I yelled so FUUUCKING LOUD it broke the lunchroom windows!"
  },
  {
   "n": 13,
   "speaker": "homie",
   "text": "Deez nu\u2014"
  }
 ],
